+A separate POSIX-shell S6 watcher polls Town Hall and the Antonina activity feed every minute. Its durable queue lives at `/var/lib/lubko/wd/viche-state/founder-inbox/`, independent of the clerk's conversation or Git checkout. Founder messages are identified by the exact author `Vitalik`. It will restart or `--steer` a busy clerk and retry a dispatch with no acknowledgement after ten minutes. This is an **urgent preemption path**, not another legislative seat and not permission to work on board issues without an explicit `phoebe-dev` assignment.
 
